==Finnish==

===Etymology===
From {{proto|Finnic|pelto|lang=fi}}, a loan from {{proto|Germanic|felþu|lang=fi}} (see English {{term|field}}). Cognate with Estonian and Livonian {{term|põld|lang=et}}, Veps {{term|püud|lang=vep}}, Votic {{term|põlto|lang=vot}}.

